// メディアプールとスタート画面の描く小道具: 中央を省く名前、斜線、札（チップ）、キーの札、アイコン、折り返し、見本の縮小画像。
// uikit にまだ無いもの（uikit に足すべきもの）をここで仮に作っている。
import {
  UkCtx, ukDrawRect, ukDrawRound, ukDrawStroke, ukDrawLine, ukDrawTri, ukDrawCircle, ukDrawText, ukDrawTextIn,
  ukTextW, ukLineH, ukFitText, ukPushClip, ukPopClip, ukSt, ukIdInt, ukKeyTake, UK_KEY_UP, UK_KEY_DOWN, UK_KEY_LEFT,
  UK_KEY_RIGHT, UK_KEY_ENTER, UK_KEY_SPACE,
} from "../uikit/core.um";
import { ukMenuItemEx, ukOpenPopup, ukClosePopups, ukPopupIsOpen, ukBeginPopup } from "../uikit/widgets.um";
import { textWidthPx } from "../ttf.um";
import { UkRect, ukRect, ukMix, ukAlpha, ukSub, ukNextChar, ukPrevChar } from "../uikit/base.um";
import { PoolTk, POOL_K_VIDEO, POOL_K_AUDIO, POOL_K_TEXT, POOL_K_IMAGE, POOL_K_COLOR } from "./pool_tokens.um";

// ---- 文字 ----

// 文字の幅だけを測る（uikit の文字の置き場 ui.tx に登録しない。uikit に足すべきもの: ukMeasure）。
// ukTextW は測った文字列を置き場に登録するので、省略や折り返しの途中の部分文字列には使わない。
export function poolMeasure(ui: UkCtx, s: string, size: f32): i32 {
  if (s.length == 0) {
    return 0;
  }
  return textWidthPx(ui.font, s, size);
}

// 文字の境目（バイトの位置。先頭の 0 と末尾の s.length を含む）。
export function poolCharBounds(s: string): usize[] {
  let b: usize[] = [0];
  let i: usize = 0;
  while (i < s.length) {
    i = ukNextChar(s, i);
    b.push(i);
  }
  return b;
}

// 幅 maxW に収まらなければ、中央を「…」にして縮める（素材名。ui.md 17.2「素材名は中央を省く」）。
// 拡張子を含む後ろを多めに残す（前 : 後ろ = 1 : 1 の幅）。二分探索で O(n log n)。置き場を汚さない。
export function poolMidEllipsis(ui: mut UkCtx, s: string, size: f32, maxW: i32): string {
  if (poolMeasure(ui, s, size) <= maxW) {
    return s.clone();
  }
  const ell = "…";
  const ew = poolMeasure(ui, ell, size);
  const half = (maxW - ew) / 2;
  if (half <= 0) {
    return ell;
  }
  const bd = poolCharBounds(s);
  const n = bd.length - 1;
  // 前: 幅 half に収まる一番長い頭（文字数 a）
  let lo: usize = 0;
  let hi: usize = n;
  while (lo < hi) {
    const mid = (lo + hi + 1) / 2;
    if (poolMeasure(ui, ukSub(s, 0, bd[mid]), size) <= half) {
      lo = mid;
    } else {
      hi = mid - 1;
    }
  }
  const a = lo;
  // 後ろ: 残りの幅に収まる一番長い尾（始まりの文字。a より後ろ）
  const restW = maxW - ew - poolMeasure(ui, ukSub(s, 0, bd[a]), size);
  let lo2: usize = a;
  let hi2: usize = n;
  while (lo2 < hi2) {
    const mid = (lo2 + hi2) / 2;
    if (poolMeasure(ui, ukSub(s, bd[mid], s.length), size) <= restW) {
      hi2 = mid;
    } else {
      lo2 = mid + 1;
    }
  }
  return ukSub(s, 0, bd[a]) + ell + ukSub(s, bd[lo2], s.length);
}

// 文字を r の中に左寄せで置き、取り消し線を引く。
export function poolStrikeText(ui: mut UkCtx, r: UkRect, s: string, size: f32, color: u32): void {
  const t = ukFitText(mut ui, s, size, r.w);
  ukDrawTextIn(mut ui, r, t, size, color, 0);
  const w = ukTextW(mut ui, t, size);
  const y = (r.y + r.h / 2) as f32 + 0.5;
  ukDrawLine(mut ui, r.x as f32, y, (r.x + w) as f32, y, 1.0, color);
}

// 行頭に置かない字（句読点・閉じ括弧・小書きのかな・長音・中黒・感嘆符など。JIS X 4051 の行頭禁則の主なもの）。
export function poolNoLineStart(c: string): bool {
  switch (c) {
    case "。": return true;
    case "、": return true;
    case "，": return true;
    case "．": return true;
    case "・": return true;
    case "：": return true;
    case "；": return true;
    case "？": return true;
    case "！": return true;
    case "…": return true;
    case "‥": return true;
    case "ー": return true;
    case "〜": return true;
    case "）": return true;
    case "」": return true;
    case "』": return true;
    case "】": return true;
    case "〕": return true;
    case "〉": return true;
    case "》": return true;
    case "］": return true;
    case "｝": return true;
    case "’": return true;
    case "”": return true;
    case "ぁ": return true;
    case "ぃ": return true;
    case "ぅ": return true;
    case "ぇ": return true;
    case "ぉ": return true;
    case "っ": return true;
    case "ゃ": return true;
    case "ゅ": return true;
    case "ょ": return true;
    case "ゎ": return true;
    case "ァ": return true;
    case "ィ": return true;
    case "ゥ": return true;
    case "ェ": return true;
    case "ォ": return true;
    case "ッ": return true;
    case "ャ": return true;
    case "ュ": return true;
    case "ョ": return true;
    case "ヮ": return true;
    case "ヵ": return true;
    case "ヶ": return true;
    case "々": return true;
    case "ゝ": return true;
    case "ゞ": return true;
    case "ヽ": return true;
    case "ヾ": return true;
    case ")": return true;
    case "]": return true;
    case "}": return true;
    case ",": return true;
    case ".": return true;
    case "!": return true;
    case "?": return true;
    case ":": return true;
    case ";": return true;
  }
  return false;
}

// 行末に置かない字（開き括弧）。
export function poolNoLineEnd(c: string): bool {
  switch (c) {
    case "（": return true;
    case "「": return true;
    case "『": return true;
    case "【": return true;
    case "〔": return true;
    case "〈": return true;
    case "《": return true;
    case "［": return true;
    case "｛": return true;
    case "‘": return true;
    case "“": return true;
    case "(": return true;
    case "[": return true;
    case "{": return true;
  }
  return false;
}

// 行頭禁則の字を前の行にぶら下げる数の上限（それより続くときは、前の字ごと次の行へ送る）。
const POOL_HANG_MAX: usize = 2;

// 文字を幅 maxW で折り返した行。文字の境目で切り、禁則を守る:
//   行頭禁則の字（。、）」ゃ ー … など）が続く間は前の行へぶら下げ（最大 2 字。行末の句読点のぶら下げ）、
//   行末に開き括弧（（「『 など）を残さない、英数字の語は途中で切らない。
// 1 行ごとに二分探索で最長の行を探すので O(n log n)。置き場を汚さない。
export function poolWrap(ui: mut UkCtx, s: string, size: f32, maxW: i32): string[] {
  let lines: string[] = [];
  const bd = poolCharBounds(s);
  const n = bd.length - 1;
  let ci: usize = 0;
  while (ci < n) {
    // この行の終わりの上限（改行の手前）
    let nl = ci;
    while (nl < n && s[bd[nl]] != 10) {
      nl++;
    }
    // ci から入る一番長い行（少なくとも 1 字）
    let lo = ci + 1;
    let hi = nl;
    if (hi < lo) {
      lo = ci;
      hi = ci;
    }
    while (lo < hi) {
      const mid = (lo + hi + 1) / 2;
      if (poolMeasure(ui, ukSub(s, bd[ci], bd[mid]), size) <= maxW) {
        lo = mid;
      } else {
        hi = mid - 1;
      }
    }
    let cut = lo;
    if (cut < nl) {
      // 行頭禁則: 続く間は前の行へぶら下げる
      let hung: usize = 0;
      while (cut < nl && hung < POOL_HANG_MAX && poolNoLineStart(ukSub(s, bd[cut], bd[cut + 1]))) {
        cut++;
        hung++;
      }
      if (cut < nl && poolNoLineStart(ukSub(s, bd[cut], bd[cut + 1]))) {
        // ぶら下げきれない: ぶら下げをやめ、前の字ごと次の行へ送る
        cut = cut - hung;
        while (cut > ci + 1 && poolNoLineStart(ukSub(s, bd[cut], bd[cut + 1]))) {
          cut--;
        }
        if (cut > ci + 1) {
          cut--;
        }
        hung = 0;
      }
      // 行末禁則: 開き括弧を行末に残さない
      if (hung == 0) {
        while (cut > ci + 1 && poolNoLineEnd(ukSub(s, bd[cut - 1], bd[cut]))) {
          cut--;
        }
      }
      // 英数字の語の途中なら、語の頭まで戻す
      if (cut < nl && poolIsWordByte(s[bd[cut]]) && poolIsWordByte(s[bd[cut] - 1])) {
        let k = cut;
        while (k > ci && poolIsWordByte(s[bd[k] - 1])) {
          k--;
        }
        if (k > ci) {
          cut = k;
        }
      }
    }
    lines.push(ukSub(s, bd[ci], bd[cut]));
    ci = cut;
    if (ci < n && s[bd[ci]] == 10) {
      ci++;
      continue;
    }
    while (ci < n && s[bd[ci]] == 32) {
      ci++;
    }
  }
  return lines;
}

function poolIsWordByte(b: u8): bool {
  return (b >= 48 && b <= 57) || (b >= 65 && b <= 90) || (b >= 97 && b <= 122) || b == 46 || b == 95;
}

// 折り返して描き、使った高さを返す。
export function poolDrawWrapped(ui: mut UkCtx, x: i32, y: i32, maxW: i32, s: string, size: f32, lineH: i32, color: u32, align: i32): i32 {
  const lines = poolWrap(mut ui, s, size, maxW);
  let yy = y;
  const th = ukLineH(ui, size);
  for (const l of lines) {
    // 行末の句読点はぶら下げる（はみ出しても省かない。中央・右寄せではぶら下げた分を幅に数えない）
    const w = Math.min(ukTextW(mut ui, l, size), maxW);
    let lx = x;
    if (align == 1) {
      lx = x + (maxW - w) / 2;
    } else if (align == 2) {
      lx = x + maxW - w;
    }
    ukDrawText(mut ui, lx, yy + (lineH - th) / 2, l, size, color);
    yy = yy + lineH;
  }
  return yy - y;
}

// 折り返したときの行の数（maxLines まで。高さを先に決めるため）。
export function poolWrapCount(ui: mut UkCtx, s: string, size: f32, maxW: i32, maxLines: i32): i32 {
  const n = poolWrap(mut ui, s, size, maxW).length as i32;
  return Math.min(n, maxLines);
}

// 折り返して最大 maxLines 行だけ描く（あふれたら最後の行を「…」で終える）。使った高さ。
export function poolDrawWrappedMax(ui: mut UkCtx, x: i32, y: i32, maxW: i32, s: string, size: f32, lineH: i32, color: u32, maxLines: i32): i32 {
  const lines = poolWrap(mut ui, s, size, maxW);
  let yy = y;
  for (let i: usize = 0; i < lines.length; i++) {
    if ((i as i32) >= maxLines) {
      break;
    }
    if ((i as i32) == maxLines - 1 && i + 1 < lines.length) {
      ukDrawTextIn(mut ui, ukRect(x, yy, maxW, lineH), ukFitText(mut ui, lines[i] + lines[i + 1], size, maxW), size, color, 0);
    } else {
      ukDrawTextIn(mut ui, ukRect(x, yy, maxW + (size as i32) * 2, lineH), lines[i], size, color, 0);
    }
    yy = yy + lineH;
  }
  return yy - y;
}

// 行の高さ（tokens の lineHeight は size から 4〜6px 大きい。ここでは文字の箱の高さに余白を足す）
export function poolLineH(ui: UkCtx, size: f32): i32 {
  return Math.max(ukLineH(ui, size), Math.floor(size * 1.38 + 0.5) as i32);
}

// ---- キーとフォーカス ----

// キー key を、修飾キー（Shift・Ctrl・Alt・Meta）がちょうど mods のときだけ取る（uikit に足すべきもの: ukKeyTakeExact）。
// ukKeyTake は修飾キーを見ないので、Ctrl+I と I を区別できない。
export function poolKeyTakeExact(ui: mut UkCtx, key: i32, mods: i32): bool {
  for (let i: usize = 0; i < ui.inp.keys.length; i++) {
    if (ui.inp.keys[i] == key && (ui.inp.keyMods[i] & 15) == mods) {
      ui.inp.keys[i] = 0;
      return true;
    }
  }
  return false;
}

// キーボードのフォーカスの輪（ui.md 19 章: 外は黒 1px、内は accent 2px、部品から 1px 離す）。
export function poolFocusRing2(ui: mut UkCtx, tk: PoolTk, r: UkRect, rad: i32): void {
  const g = tk.hair;
  const inner = ukRect(r.x - g - tk.focusW, r.y - g - tk.focusW, r.w + (g + tk.focusW) * 2, r.h + (g + tk.focusW) * 2);
  ukDrawStroke(mut ui, inner, rad + g + tk.focusW, tk.focusW, tk.accent);
  const outer = ukRect(inner.x - tk.hair, inner.y - tk.hair, inner.w + tk.hair * 2, inner.h + tk.hair * 2);
  ukDrawStroke(mut ui, outer, rad + g + tk.focusW + tk.hair, tk.hair, tk.selOuter);
}

// ---- 線と模様 ----

// 斜線（45°、period 画素ごと）。線の太さは縞の垂直の間隔（period/√2）の半分で、線と隙間が同じ幅になる
// （モックの repeating-linear-gradient(…, c 0 3px, transparent 3px 6px) と同じ割合）。
// rightUp なら右上がり（オフライン）、そうでなければ右下がり（仮の模様）。
export function poolHatch(ui: mut UkCtx, r: UkRect, color: u32, period: i32, rightUp: bool): void {
  if (r.w <= 0 || r.h <= 0) {
    return;
  }
  ukPushClip(mut ui, r);
  const p = Math.max(period, 2);
  const t = (p as f32) * 0.70710678 * 0.5;
  const n = (r.w + r.h) / p + 2;
  const h = (r.h as f32) + 2.0;
  const x = r.x as f32;
  const yt = (r.y as f32) - 1.0;
  const yb = (r.y + r.h) as f32 + 1.0;
  for (let k = 0; k < n; k++) {
    const o = (k * p) as f32;
    if (rightUp) {
      ukDrawLine(mut ui, x + o, yb, x + o - h, yt, t, color);
    } else {
      ukDrawLine(mut ui, x + o - h, yt, x + o, yb, t, color);
    }
  }
  ukPopClip(mut ui);
}

// 点線の枠（3-2。まだ確かめていないもの）。
export function poolDashRect(ui: mut UkCtx, r: UkRect, t: i32, on: i32, off: i32, color: u32): void {
  const step = Math.max(on + off, 2);
  let x = r.x;
  while (x < r.x + r.w) {
    const w = Math.min(on, r.x + r.w - x);
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(x, r.y, w, t), color);
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(x, r.y + r.h - t, w, t), color);
    x = x + step;
  }
  let y = r.y;
  while (y < r.y + r.h) {
    const h = Math.min(on, r.y + r.h - y);
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(r.x, y, t, h), color);
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(r.x + r.w - t, y, t, h), color);
    y = y + step;
  }
}

// 1px の枠（線は内側）。
export function poolFrame(ui: mut UkCtx, r: UkRect, t: i32, color: u32): void {
  ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(r.x, r.y, r.w, t), color);
  ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(r.x, r.y + r.h - t, r.w, t), color);
  ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(r.x, r.y + t, t, r.h - 2 * t), color);
  ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(r.x + r.w - t, r.y + t, t, r.h - 2 * t), color);
}

// ---- 札（チップ） ----

// 札の幅（icon は POOL_I_*、0 なら無し）。
export function poolChipW(ui: mut UkCtx, tk: PoolTk, text: string, icon: i32, size: f32): i32 {
  let w = ukTextW(mut ui, text, size) + tk.s2 * 2 - 2;
  if (icon != 0) {
    w = w + tk.iconSm * 3 / 4 + tk.s1;
  }
  return w;
}

// 札を (x, y) に描き、幅を返す。高さ h、地 bg、文字 fg。
export function poolChip(ui: mut UkCtx, tk: PoolTk, x: i32, y: i32, h: i32, text: string, icon: i32, bg: u32, fg: u32, size: f32): i32 {
  const w = poolChipW(mut ui, tk, text, icon, size);
  ukDrawRound(mut ui, ukRect(x, y, w, h), tk.rSm, bg);
  let tx = x + tk.s2 - 1;
  if (icon != 0) {
    const is = tk.iconSm * 3 / 4;
    poolIcon(mut ui, ukRect(tx, y + (h - is) / 2, is, is), icon, fg);
    tx = tx + is + tk.s1;
  }
  ukDrawTextIn(mut ui, ukRect(tx, y, x + w - tx, h), text, size, fg, 0);
  return w;
}

// キーの札（"Ctrl N"）。bg と枠の色を渡す（ボタンの中では地を透明にする）。幅を返す。
export function poolKbd(ui: mut UkCtx, tk: PoolTk, x: i32, y: i32, text: string, bg: u32, border: u32, fg: u32): i32 {
  const h = tk.fsXs as i32 + 7;
  const w = ukTextW(mut ui, text, tk.fsXs) + tk.s2 + 2;
  if ((bg >> 24) != 0) {
    ukDrawRound(mut ui, ukRect(x, y, w, h), tk.rSm, bg);
  }
  ukDrawStroke(mut ui, ukRect(x, y, w, h), tk.rSm, tk.hair, border);
  ukDrawTextIn(mut ui, ukRect(x, y, w, h), text, tk.fsXs, fg, 1);
  return w;
}

export function poolKbdW(ui: mut UkCtx, tk: PoolTk, text: string): i32 {
  return ukTextW(mut ui, text, tk.fsXs) + tk.s2 + 2;
}

// ---- アイコン（16×16 の格子、線 1.5。uikit の UK_I_* に無いもの） ----

export const POOL_I_GRID: i32 = 1;
export const POOL_I_LIST: i32 = 2;
export const POOL_I_PLUS: i32 = 3;
export const POOL_I_SEARCH: i32 = 4;
export const POOL_I_BOLT: i32 = 5;
export const POOL_I_ERROR: i32 = 6;      // 丸に ×（エラーは必ずこれと文を添える）
export const POOL_I_VIDEO: i32 = 7;
export const POOL_I_AUDIO: i32 = 8;
export const POOL_I_TEXT: i32 = 9;
export const POOL_I_IMAGE: i32 = 10;
export const POOL_I_COLOR: i32 = 11;
export const POOL_I_FILE: i32 = 12;
export const POOL_I_DROP: i32 = 13;      // 下向きの矢印と受け皿
export const POOL_I_WARN: i32 = 14;      // 三角に !
export const POOL_I_SPARK: i32 = 15;     // ✦（AI）
export const POOL_I_KEYBOARD: i32 = 16;
export const POOL_I_GEAR: i32 = 17;
export const POOL_I_CHEV_D: i32 = 18;
export const POOL_I_CHEV_R: i32 = 19;
export const POOL_I_CLOSE: i32 = 20;
export const POOL_I_CHECK: i32 = 21;
export const POOL_I_FOLDER: i32 = 22;
export const POOL_I_ARROW_UP: i32 = 23;
export const POOL_I_ARROW_DOWN: i32 = 24;

// 素材の種類のアイコン。
export function poolKindIcon(kind: i32): i32 {
  if (kind == POOL_K_AUDIO) {
    return POOL_I_AUDIO;
  } else if (kind == POOL_K_TEXT) {
    return POOL_I_TEXT;
  } else if (kind == POOL_K_IMAGE) {
    return POOL_I_IMAGE;
  } else if (kind == POOL_K_COLOR) {
    return POOL_I_COLOR;
  }
  return POOL_I_VIDEO;
}

// 4 つの角の星（中心 cx, cy、角までの長さ R、へこみの深さ ri）。8 つの三角で塗る。
function poolStar(ui: mut UkCtx, cx: f32, cy: f32, R: f32, ri: f32, c: u32): void {
  const tx: f32[4] = [0.0, R, 0.0, -R];
  const ty: f32[4] = [-R, 0.0, R, 0.0];
  const d = ri * 0.70710678;
  const ix: f32[4] = [d, d, -d, -d];
  const iy: f32[4] = [-d, d, d, -d];
  for (let k: usize = 0; k < 4; k++) {
    const k2 = (k + 1) % 4;
    ukDrawTri(mut ui, cx, cy, cx + tx[k], cy + ty[k], cx + ix[k], cy + iy[k], c);
    ukDrawTri(mut ui, cx, cy, cx + ix[k], cy + iy[k], cx + tx[k2], cy + ty[k2], c);
  }
}

export function poolIcon(ui: mut UkCtx, r: UkRect, icon: i32, c: u32): void {
  const s = (Math.min(r.w, r.h) as f32);
  const u = s / 16.0;
  const x0 = (r.x as f32) + ((r.w as f32) - s) * 0.5;
  const y0 = (r.y as f32) + ((r.h as f32) - s) * 0.5;
  const t = Math.max(1.5 * u, 1.0);
  if (icon == POOL_I_GRID) {
    const q = Math.floor(4.5 * u + 0.5) as i32;
    const a = Math.floor(x0 + 2.5 * u) as i32;
    const b = Math.floor(y0 + 2.5 * u) as i32;
    const g = Math.floor(9.0 * u) as i32;
    ukDrawStroke(mut ui, ukRect(a, b, q, q), 1, 1, c);
    ukDrawStroke(mut ui, ukRect(a + g - q + q, b, q, q), 1, 1, c);
    ukDrawStroke(mut ui, ukRect(a, b + g - q + q, q, q), 1, 1, c);
    ukDrawStroke(mut ui, ukRect(a + g - q + q, b + g - q + q, q, q), 1, 1, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_LIST) {
    for (let k = 0; k < 3; k++) {
      const yy = y0 + (4.0 + (k as f32) * 4.0) * u;
      ukDrawCircle(mut ui, x0 + 3.0 * u, yy, 0.9 * u, 0.0, c);
      ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 6.0 * u, yy, x0 + 13.5 * u, yy, t, c);
    }
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_PLUS) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 3.0 * u, y0 + 8.0 * u, x0 + 13.0 * u, y0 + 8.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 3.0 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 13.0 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_SEARCH) {
    ukDrawCircle(mut ui, x0 + 7.0 * u, y0 + 7.0 * u, 4.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 10.3 * u, y0 + 10.3 * u, x0 + 13.5 * u, y0 + 13.5 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_BOLT) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 9.5 * u, y0 + 2.0 * u, x0 + 4.5 * u, y0 + 9.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 4.5 * u, y0 + 9.0 * u, x0 + 11.5 * u, y0 + 7.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 11.5 * u, y0 + 7.0 * u, x0 + 6.5 * u, y0 + 14.0 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_ERROR) {
    ukDrawCircle(mut ui, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 8.0 * u, 6.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 5.8 * u, y0 + 5.8 * u, x0 + 10.2 * u, y0 + 10.2 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 10.2 * u, y0 + 5.8 * u, x0 + 5.8 * u, y0 + 10.2 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_VIDEO) {
    ukDrawStroke(mut ui, ukRect(Math.floor(x0 + 2.0 * u) as i32, Math.floor(y0 + 3.0 * u) as i32, Math.floor(12.0 * u) as i32, Math.floor(10.0 * u) as i32), Math.max(Math.floor(1.5 * u) as i32, 1), 1, c);
    ukDrawTri(mut ui, x0 + 7.0 * u, y0 + 6.0 * u, x0 + 7.0 * u, y0 + 10.0 * u, x0 + 10.2 * u, y0 + 8.0 * u, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_AUDIO) {
    const hs: f32[5] = [3.0, 7.0, 10.0, 6.0, 3.5];
    for (let k: usize = 0; k < 5; k++) {
      const xx = x0 + (3.5 + (k as f32) * 2.25) * u;
      ukDrawLine(mut ui, xx, y0 + (8.0 - hs[k] * 0.5) * u, xx, y0 + (8.0 + hs[k] * 0.5) * u, t, c);
    }
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_TEXT) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 3.5 * u, y0 + 3.5 * u, x0 + 12.5 * u, y0 + 3.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 3.5 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 13.0 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_IMAGE) {
    ukDrawStroke(mut ui, ukRect(Math.floor(x0 + 2.0 * u) as i32, Math.floor(y0 + 3.0 * u) as i32, Math.floor(12.0 * u) as i32, Math.floor(10.0 * u) as i32), 2, 1, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 3.5 * u, y0 + 11.5 * u, x0 + 7.0 * u, y0 + 8.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 7.0 * u, y0 + 8.0 * u, x0 + 12.5 * u, y0 + 11.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawCircle(mut ui, x0 + 10.5 * u, y0 + 6.0 * u, 1.2 * u, 0.0, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_COLOR) {
    ukDrawRound(mut ui, ukRect(Math.floor(x0 + 3.0 * u) as i32, Math.floor(y0 + 3.0 * u) as i32, Math.floor(10.0 * u) as i32, Math.floor(10.0 * u) as i32), 2, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_FILE) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 4.0 * u, y0 + 2.0 * u, x0 + 9.5 * u, y0 + 2.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 9.5 * u, y0 + 2.0 * u, x0 + 12.5 * u, y0 + 5.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 12.5 * u, y0 + 5.0 * u, x0 + 12.5 * u, y0 + 14.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 12.5 * u, y0 + 14.0 * u, x0 + 4.0 * u, y0 + 14.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 4.0 * u, y0 + 14.0 * u, x0 + 4.0 * u, y0 + 2.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 9.5 * u, y0 + 2.0 * u, x0 + 9.5 * u, y0 + 5.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 9.5 * u, y0 + 5.0 * u, x0 + 12.5 * u, y0 + 5.0 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_DROP) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 2.0 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 10.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 4.5 * u, y0 + 6.5 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 10.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 11.5 * u, y0 + 6.5 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 10.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 2.5 * u, y0 + 10.5 * u, x0 + 2.5 * u, y0 + 13.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 2.5 * u, y0 + 13.5 * u, x0 + 13.5 * u, y0 + 13.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 13.5 * u, y0 + 13.5 * u, x0 + 13.5 * u, y0 + 10.5 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_WARN) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 2.0 * u, x0 + 14.5 * u, y0 + 13.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 14.5 * u, y0 + 13.5 * u, x0 + 1.5 * u, y0 + 13.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 1.5 * u, y0 + 13.5 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 2.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 6.0 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 9.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawCircle(mut ui, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 11.6 * u, 0.9 * u, 0.0, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_SPARK) {
    // モックの i-ai と同じ形: 辺をへこませた 4 つの角の星（大）と、右下の小さな星。中央を太くして「＋」と見分ける
    poolStar(mut ui, x0 + 6.0 * u, y0 + 6.7 * u, 4.8 * u, 2.0 * u, c);
    poolStar(mut ui, x0 + 11.8 * u, y0 + 11.6 * u, 2.6 * u, 1.1 * u, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_KEYBOARD) {
    ukDrawStroke(mut ui, ukRect(Math.floor(x0 + 1.5 * u) as i32, Math.floor(y0 + 4.0 * u) as i32, Math.floor(13.0 * u) as i32, Math.floor(8.5 * u) as i32), 2, 1, c);
    for (let k = 0; k < 4; k++) {
      ukDrawCircle(mut ui, x0 + (4.5 + (k as f32) * 2.4) * u, y0 + 6.8 * u, 0.6 * u, 0.0, c);
    }
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 5.0 * u, y0 + 9.8 * u, x0 + 11.0 * u, y0 + 9.8 * u, t * 0.8, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_GEAR) {
    ukDrawCircle(mut ui, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 8.0 * u, 2.8 * u, t, c);
    const dx: f32[8] = [1.0, 0.7071, 0.0, -0.7071, -1.0, -0.7071, 0.0, 0.7071];
    const dy: f32[8] = [0.0, 0.7071, 1.0, 0.7071, 0.0, -0.7071, -1.0, -0.7071];
    for (let k: usize = 0; k < 8; k++) {
      ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + (8.0 + dx[k] * 4.6) * u, y0 + (8.0 + dy[k] * 4.6) * u, x0 + (8.0 + dx[k] * 6.4) * u, y0 + (8.0 + dy[k] * 6.4) * u, t, c);
    }
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_CHEV_D) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 4.5 * u, y0 + 6.5 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 10.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 10.0 * u, x0 + 11.5 * u, y0 + 6.5 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_CHEV_R) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 6.5 * u, y0 + 4.5 * u, x0 + 10.0 * u, y0 + 8.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 10.0 * u, y0 + 8.0 * u, x0 + 6.5 * u, y0 + 11.5 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_CLOSE) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 4.0 * u, y0 + 4.0 * u, x0 + 12.0 * u, y0 + 12.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 12.0 * u, y0 + 4.0 * u, x0 + 4.0 * u, y0 + 12.0 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_CHECK) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 3.5 * u, y0 + 8.5 * u, x0 + 6.5 * u, y0 + 11.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 6.5 * u, y0 + 11.5 * u, x0 + 12.5 * u, y0 + 4.5 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_FOLDER) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 2.0 * u, y0 + 4.0 * u, x0 + 6.5 * u, y0 + 4.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 6.5 * u, y0 + 4.0 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 5.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 5.5 * u, x0 + 14.0 * u, y0 + 5.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 14.0 * u, y0 + 5.5 * u, x0 + 14.0 * u, y0 + 12.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 14.0 * u, y0 + 12.5 * u, x0 + 2.0 * u, y0 + 12.5 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 2.0 * u, y0 + 12.5 * u, x0 + 2.0 * u, y0 + 4.0 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_ARROW_UP) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 3.0 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 13.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 4.5 * u, y0 + 6.5 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 3.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 11.5 * u, y0 + 6.5 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 3.0 * u, t, c);
  } else if (icon == POOL_I_ARROW_DOWN) {
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 3.0 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 13.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 4.5 * u, y0 + 9.5 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 13.0 * u, t, c);
    ukDrawLine(mut ui, x0 + 11.5 * u, y0 + 9.5 * u, x0 + 8.0 * u, y0 + 13.0 * u, t, c);
  }
}

// ---- 見本の縮小画像 ----
// 実物では縮小画像の画素を描く（uikit の画像の命令が来たら置き換える）。見本ではモックアップと同じ絵柄を図形で描く。

export const POOL_TH_SHOP: i32 = 0;
export const POOL_TH_HANDS: i32 = 1;
export const POOL_TH_STREET: i32 = 2;
export const POOL_TH_FACE: i32 = 3;
export const POOL_TH_STEAM: i32 = 4;
export const POOL_TH_NIGHT: i32 = 5;
export const POOL_TH_WAVE: i32 = 6;     // 音の素材（波形）
export const POOL_TH_TITLE: i32 = 7;    // 文字の素材
export const POOL_TH_PIC: i32 = 8;      // 本物の縮小画像（呼ぶ側が絵を写す。PoolState の picIds / picRs）

// 縦の 3 色のグラデーション（a → b を [0, m)、b → c を [m, 1]）。
function poolVGrad(ui: mut UkCtx, r: UkRect, a: u32, b: u32, c: u32, m: f32): void {
  const step = 2;
  let y = 0;
  while (y < r.h) {
    const f = ((y as f32) + 1.0) / (r.h as f32);
    let col = a;
    if (f < m) {
      col = ukMix(a, b, Math.floor(f / m * 256.0) as i32);
    } else {
      col = ukMix(b, c, Math.floor((f - m) / Math.max(1.0 - m, 0.001) * 256.0) as i32);
    }
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(r.x, r.y + y, r.w, Math.min(step, r.h - y)), col);
    y = y + step;
  }
}

// 中心から外へ色が変わる丸（同心の円を重ねる）。
function poolRadial(ui: mut UkCtx, cx: f32, cy: f32, r0: f32, inner: u32, outer: u32, steps: i32): void {
  for (let k = steps; k >= 1; k--) {
    const f = (k as f32) / (steps as f32);
    ukDrawCircle(mut ui, cx, cy, r0 * f, 0.0, ukMix(inner, outer, Math.floor(f * 256.0) as i32));
  }
}

// 見本の縮小画像を r に描く（角は描いた後に呼ぶ側で丸めない。縮小画像は 3px の角を模して四隅を地の色で塗る）。
export function poolDemoThumb(ui: mut UkCtx, r: UkRect, kind: i32, seed: i32, tk: PoolTk): void {
  ukPushClip(mut ui, r);
  const w = r.w as f32;
  const h = r.h as f32;
  if (kind == POOL_TH_SHOP) {
    const a = Math.floor(h * 0.18) as i32;
    const b = Math.floor(h * 0.70) as i32;
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(r.x, r.y, r.w, a), 0xff1d2a3a);
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(r.x, r.y + a, r.w, b - a), 0xff4a3424);
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(r.x, r.y + b, r.w, r.h - b), 0xffc8b48e);
  } else if (kind == POOL_TH_HANDS) {
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, r, 0xff1b2a30);
    const R = Math.max(w, h) * 0.75;
    poolRadial(mut ui, (r.x as f32) + w * 0.5, (r.y as f32) + h * 0.6, R, 0xff2e4a52, 0xff1b2a30, 16);
    poolRadial(mut ui, (r.x as f32) + w * 0.5, (r.y as f32) + h * 0.6, R * 0.5, 0xffcfe3e6, 0xff2e4a52, 24);
    ukDrawCircle(mut ui, (r.x as f32) + w * 0.5, (r.y as f32) + h * 0.6, R * 0.2, 0.0, 0xffcfe3e6);
  } else if (kind == POOL_TH_STREET) {
    poolVGrad(mut ui, r, 0xfff2b880, 0xffb98a7a, 0xff4d3d3d, 0.6);
  } else if (kind == POOL_TH_FACE) {
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, r, 0xff1b1b1b);
    const R = Math.max(w, h) * 0.46;
    ukDrawCircle(mut ui, (r.x as f32) + w * 0.5, (r.y as f32) + h * 0.42, R, 0.0, 0xff3c5b74);
    ukDrawCircle(mut ui, (r.x as f32) + w * 0.5, (r.y as f32) + h * 0.42, R * 0.48, 0.0, 0xffc99573);
  } else if (kind == POOL_TH_STEAM) {
    poolVGrad(mut ui, r, 0xff9aa6ab, 0xffe9ecee, 0xff6d7a80, 0.5);
  } else if (kind == POOL_TH_NIGHT) {
    poolVGrad(mut ui, r, 0xff1b2340, 0xff3b2f4a, 0xfff2b880, 0.6);
  } else if (kind == POOL_TH_WAVE) {
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, r, tk.kindFace[POOL_K_AUDIO as usize]);
    const mk = tk.kindMark[POOL_K_AUDIO as usize];
    const cy = (r.y as f32) + h * 0.5;
    let rs = (seed * 9301 + 49297) % 233280;
    let x = 2;
    while (x < r.w - 2) {
      rs = (rs * 9301 + 49297) % 233280;
      const env = 0.35 + 0.65 * Math.abs(((x as f32) / 23.0 + (seed as f32)) % 2.0 - 1.0);
      const a = (0.15 + 0.85 * (rs as f32) / 233280.0) * env * h * 0.42;
      ukDrawRect(mut ui, ukRect(r.x + x, Math.floor(cy - a) as i32, 2, Math.max(Math.floor(a * 2.0) as i32, 1)), ukAlpha(mk, 160));
      x = x + 3;
    }
  } else if (kind == POOL_TH_TITLE) {
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, r, tk.kindFace[POOL_K_TEXT as usize]);
    poolIcon(mut ui, ukRect(r.x + r.w / 2 - 12, r.y + r.h / 2 - 12, 24, 24), POOL_I_TEXT, tk.kindMark[POOL_K_TEXT as usize]);
  } else {
    ukDrawRect(mut ui, r, tk.bg3);
  }
  ukPopClip(mut ui);
}

// 縮小画像の角を丸く見せる（四隅に地の色の小さな三角を置く）。radius が 3 程度のときの近似。
export function poolCornerMask(ui: mut UkCtx, r: UkRect, rad: i32, bg: u32): void {
  if (rad <= 1) {
    return;
  }
  const q = rad as f32;
  const x0 = r.x as f32;
  const y0 = r.y as f32;
  const x1 = (r.x + r.w) as f32;
  const y1 = (r.y + r.h) as f32;
  ukDrawTri(mut ui, x0, y0, x0 + q, y0, x0, y0 + q, bg);
  ukDrawTri(mut ui, x1, y0, x1 - q, y0, x1, y0 + q, bg);
  ukDrawTri(mut ui, x0, y1, x0 + q, y1, x0, y1 - q, bg);
  ukDrawTri(mut ui, x1, y1, x1 - q, y1, x1, y1 - q, bg);
}

// ---- キーボードで操るメニュー（uikit のメニューの項目はフォーカスできないので、ここで仮に作る。uikit に足すべきもの） ----
//
// 使い方（ポップアップの中）:
//   let kb = poolMenuKbBegin(mut ui, popupId);   // ukBeginPopup のすぐあと
//   if (poolMenuItemKb(mut ui, mut kb, "項目", "Ctrl+X", false)) { ... }
//   if (poolBeginSubMenuKb(mut ui, mut kb, "サブ")) { let kb2 = poolMenuKbBegin(...); ...; poolMenuKbEnd(mut ui, kb2, id2); ukEndMenu(mut ui); }
//   poolMenuKbEnd(mut ui, kb, popupId);          // ukEndPopup / ukEndMenu の前
// いちばん上のポップアップだけが ↑↓（項目を選ぶ）・Enter / Space（押す）・→（サブメニューを開く）・←（サブメニューを閉じる）を取る。
// カーソルは ukSt(popupId).i[2]（0 はどれも指していない、k+1 は k 番目）に覚える。
export struct PoolMenuKb {
  id: u32;
  cur: i32;
  n: i32;
  delta: i32;
  go: bool;
  open: bool;
  top: bool;
}

export function poolMenuKbBegin(ui: mut UkCtx, popupId: u32): PoolMenuKb {
  const si = ukSt(mut ui, popupId);
  let kb: PoolMenuKb = { id: popupId, cur: ui.st[si].i[2] - 1, n: 0, delta: 0, go: false, open: false, top: false };
  // 右クリックで開いたフレームは、カーソルを消す
  if ((ui.inp.pressed & 4) != 0) {
    kb.cur = -1;
  }
  kb.top = (ui.popups.length as i32) == ui.popupDepth;
  if (kb.top) {
    if (ukKeyTake(mut ui, UK_KEY_DOWN)) {
      kb.delta = 1;
    }
    if (ukKeyTake(mut ui, UK_KEY_UP)) {
      kb.delta = -1;
    }
    if (ukKeyTake(mut ui, UK_KEY_ENTER) || ukKeyTake(mut ui, UK_KEY_SPACE)) {
      kb.go = kb.cur >= 0;
    }
    if (ukKeyTake(mut ui, UK_KEY_RIGHT)) {
      kb.open = true;
    }
    if (ui.popupDepth >= 2 && ukKeyTake(mut ui, UK_KEY_LEFT)) {
      // サブメニューを閉じて親へ戻る
      ui.popups.pop();
      ui.popupX.pop();
      ui.popupY.pop();
      ui.wantFrame = true;
    }
  }
  return kb;
}

// カーソルの位置の輪（文字を隠さないよう、枠だけ）。
function poolMenuKbMark(ui: mut UkCtx, kb: PoolMenuKb, idx: i32): bool {
  const here = kb.cur == idx;
  if (here) {
    const lr = ui.lastRect;
    const rad = ui.theme.radiusSm;
    const fc = ui.theme.focus;
    ukDrawStroke(mut ui, lr, rad, 2, fc);
  }
  return here;
}

// メニューの項目。マウスで押したか、カーソルの位置で Enter を押したら true（ポップアップを全部閉じる）。
export function poolMenuItemKb(ui: mut UkCtx, kb: mut PoolMenuKb, label: string, shortcut: string, checked: bool): bool {
  const h = ukMenuItemEx(mut ui, label, shortcut, checked, false);
  const idx = kb.n;
  kb.n = kb.n + 1;
  if (h.hover && ui.inp.moved) {
    kb.cur = idx;
  }
  const here = poolMenuKbMark(mut ui, kb, idx);
  if (here && kb.go && kb.top) {
    ukClosePopups(mut ui);
    return true;
  }
  return h.clicked && ui.disabled == 0;
}

// サブメニュー。乗るか、カーソルの位置で → / Enter を押すと右に開く。開いていれば true（ukEndMenu で閉じる）。
export function poolBeginSubMenuKb(ui: mut UkCtx, kb: mut PoolMenuKb, label: string): bool {
  const h = ukMenuItemEx(mut ui, label, "", false, true);
  const r = ui.lastRect;
  const idx = kb.n;
  kb.n = kb.n + 1;
  if (h.hover && ui.inp.moved) {
    kb.cur = idx;
  }
  const here = poolMenuKbMark(mut ui, kb, idx);
  const id = ukIdInt(ui, label, 7);
  const kbOpen = here && kb.top && (kb.open || kb.go);
  if (((h.hover || h.pressed) || kbOpen) && !ukPopupIsOpen(ui, id)) {
    ukOpenPopup(mut ui, id, r.x + r.w + 2, r.y - Math.max(ui.theme.pad / 2, 2));
    if (kbOpen) {
      const si = ukSt(mut ui, id);
      ui.st[si].i[2] = 1;
    }
  }
  return ukBeginPopup(mut ui, id, 160);
}

export function poolMenuKbEnd(ui: mut UkCtx, kb: PoolMenuKb, popupId: u32): void {
  let cur = kb.cur;
  if (kb.delta != 0 && kb.n > 0) {
    if (cur < 0) {
      cur = kb.delta > 0 ? 0 : kb.n - 1;
    } else {
      cur = (cur + kb.delta + kb.n) % kb.n;
    }
    ui.wantFrame = true;
  }
  if (cur >= kb.n) {
    cur = kb.n - 1;
  }
  const si = ukSt(mut ui, popupId);
  ui.st[si].i[2] = cur + 1;
}

// ポップアップをキーボードで開く（カーソルを最初の項目に置く）。
export function poolOpenPopupKb(ui: mut UkCtx, id: u32, x: i32, y: i32): void {
  ukOpenPopup(mut ui, id, x, y);
  const si = ukSt(mut ui, id);
  ui.st[si].i[2] = 1;
}

// 回る印（ui.md 13.2: 14px、1 周 900ms）。8 つの点の明るさを回す。
export function poolSpinner(ui: mut UkCtx, cx: f32, cy: f32, size: f32, color: u32): void {
  const ph = ui.now / 0.9;
  const step = Math.floor((ph - Math.floor(ph)) * 8.0) as i32;
  const dx: f32[8] = [0.0, 0.7071, 1.0, 0.7071, 0.0, -0.7071, -1.0, -0.7071];
  const dy: f32[8] = [-1.0, -0.7071, 0.0, 0.7071, 1.0, 0.7071, 0.0, -0.7071];
  const rr = size * 0.5 - 1.5;
  for (let k = 0; k < 8; k++) {
    const age = (step - k + 8) % 8;
    const a = 255 - age * 28;
    ukDrawCircle(mut ui, cx + dx[k as usize] * rr, cy + dy[k as usize] * rr, 1.4 * size / 14.0, 0.0, ukAlpha(color, a));
  }
  ui.wantFrame = true;
}
